OL,3,ARussia-bound ship attacked in Gulf of  
OL,4,AFinland                                
OL,6,FA Russian cargo vessel bound for the   
OL,7,Fcountry's Baltic exclave Kaliningrad   
OL,8,Fhas been hit by a drone attack in the  
OL,9,Feastern Gulf of Finland, Russian and   
OL,10,FFinnish authorities say.               
OL,12,FThe ship - the Sparta II - caught on   
OL,13,Ffire after the strike on Saturday      
OL,14,Fmorning, before drifting into Finnish  
OL,15,Fwaters. Finnish defence forces said    
OL,16,FUkraine was likely behind the attack.  
OL,17,FKyiv has yet to comment.               
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
