OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARussia-bound ship attacked in Gulf of  
OL,4,AFinland                                
OL,6,F"War is spilling over into our         
OL,7,Fimmediate vicinity," Finnish Prime     
OL,8,FMinister Petteri Orpo said. "Ukraine   
OL,9,Fhas the right to fight back against the
OL,10,Faggressor."                            
OL,12,FKaliningrad Governor Alexei            
OL,13,FBesprozvannykh said two drones had been
OL,14,Fused, based on preliminary information,
OL,15,Fand there was "no threat" to the       
OL,16,Fterritory's supplies.                  
